{
  "_comment": [
    "The modules and names a plugin may import from Nastech core. `nastech plugins validate` warns on any other",
    "Nastech import (nastech_cli/plugin_validate_private_imports.py), and scripts/gen_plugin_api_docs.py renders",
    "website/docs/developer-guide/plugins/public-api.md from this file.",
    "A `module` entry allows the module and its non-underscore names; `module:Name` allows that one name.",
    "Harvested from the Nastech-module imports in the developer-guide and plugin docs, what PluginContext hands",
    "out, and the names those pages tell authors to call, raise, return or subclass. Re-harvest when they change."
